(
    title: "Alpha Beam with Ernie",
    developer: Some("Michael Callahan, Preston Stuart"),
    description: Some("An educational game for young children starring Sesame Street\'s Ernie. You fly a small shuttle around the screen to collect fuel tanks, each labelled with a letter of the alphabet, and carry them back to Ernie\'s spaceship so he can fly home to Earth — a letter-recognition exercise dressed up as a space rescue, aimed at pre-readers."),
